    corp_page_title: "Panama Corporation Formation 2026 — S.A., Foundations & Bank Accounts",
    corp_page_desc: "Form a Panama corporation (S.A.) or Private Interest Foundation with a corporate bank account. Tax efficiency, asset protection, and global banking access. Free consultation.",
    corp_faq1_q: "Do I need Panamanian residency to form a corporation?",
    corp_faq1_a: "No. Panama corporations can be owned and operated by foreigners with no residency requirement — you can manage the company from any country.",
    corp_faq2_q: "How long does it take to open a corporate bank account after forming a Panama corporation?",
