    corp_faq3_q: "What's the difference between a Panama Corporation (S.A.) and a Private Interest Foundation?",
    corp_faq3_a: "A Corporation (S.A.) is typically used for active business and trade, while a Private Interest Foundation is designed for asset protection, estate planning, and holding assets outside of a commercial operating structure. We help you choose based on your goals.",

    re_title: "Real Estate Closings in Panama",
